# Prettier checks the JavaScript, the JSON and the configuration files of the documentation
# site. It also skips what .gitignore names.

package-lock.json
# Written by the coverage ratchet of paxel/gates.
.github/badges/

# The schemas, the test vectors and the data of the conformance suite: a published schema is
# never edited in place, and the vectors' bytes are what the libraries compare against, so no
# formatter touches them.
types/
vectors/
conformance/

# Markdown and YAML keep the layout they are written in: the tables with aligned pipes and the
# aligned comments, which prettier would rewrite.
*.md
*.yml
*.yaml

# The page fragments in site/: reformatting them would change every line.
*.html
